 "arch": "A 4-layer transformer with no LayerNorm. Vocabulary of 5 tokens; the input is a sequence of 5 tokens; residual stream width 35.\n  x = W_E[tokens] + W_pos\n  layer 0: attention (1 head of size 10, bidirectional, biases b_Q, b_K, b_V, b_O): x = x + softmax((x W_Q + b_Q)(x W_K + b_K)^T / sqrt(10)) (x W_V + b_V) W_O + b_O;  then MLP (20 ReLU neurons): x = x + relu(x W_in + b_in) W_out + b_out\n  layer 1: attention (1 head of size 10, bidirectional, biases b_Q, b_K, b_V, b_O): x = x + softmax((x W_Q + b_Q)(x W_K + b_K)^T / sqrt(10)) (x W_V + b_V) W_O + b_O;  then MLP (20 ReLU neurons): x = x + relu(x W_in + b_in) W_out + b_out\n  layer 2: attention (1 head of size 10, bidirectional, biases b_Q, b_K, b_V, b_O): x = x + softmax((x W_Q + b_Q)(x W_K + b_K)^T / sqrt(10)) (x W_V + b_V) W_O + b_O;  then MLP (20 ReLU neurons): x = x + relu(x W_in + b_in) W_out + b_out\n  layer 3: attention (1 head of size 10, bidirectional, biases b_Q, b_K, b_V, b_O): x = x + softmax((x W_Q + b_Q)(x W_K + b_K)^T / sqrt(10)) (x W_V + b_V) W_O + b_O;  then MLP (20 ReLU neurons): x = x + relu(x W_in + b_in) W_out + b_out\n  output = x[positions 1..4] @ W_U: 3 numbers for each of the last 4 positions, flattened as (position - 1) * 3 + class. The network's decision at a position is its largest of those 3 numbers.",
